.streamlit/secrets.toml

# Coding-agent definitions — local only, never pushed to this public repo
.claude/
CLAUDE.md
AGENTS.md

# Build output — published to Pages from a CI artifact, never committed
dist/

# Design specs and implementation plans — local only. These carry agent-directed
# workflow instructions, so they stay out of the public repository.
docs/superpowers/

# Brainstorming session scratch — mockups written by the visual companion while
# a design is being worked out. Same rule as docs/superpowers/: local only.
.superpowers/

# Raw upstream downloads a curator reprocesses into mirrors/ — journal
# supplementary workbooks, bulk archive dumps. Local only, and deliberately so:
# they are large, their redistribution terms are the article's rather than the
# data's, and the reviewable artifact is the extracted mirror TSV, not the
# workbook it came from. Provenance travels instead as a URL and a sha256
# recorded beside each mirror, so a curator can prove they hold the same file.
local/

# File-manager droppings. Never curated content; the stray-entry sweeps ignore
# them too, see OS_METADATA in src/chd_atlas/fs.py.
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
